-weight-label)">Graph databases</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text)">Dependency and impact graphs come from TypeScript AST analysis, updated as the code changes. No separate graph store.</span></li><li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="align-self: flex-start; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); white-space: nowrap; font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Conversational memory</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text)">Agents share no chat history. Every bit of state lives in immutable, versioned artifacts, so any run can be replayed.</span></li><li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="align-self: flex-start; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); white-space: nowrap; font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Kubernetes</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text)">Cloudflare Workers and Queues run the platform. Kubernetes would add operations work with no value for the first version.</span></li><li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="align-self: flex-start; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); white-space: nowrap; font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Event sourcing</span><span style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text)">Versioned artifacts and workflow snapshots already give a full audit trail, without the complexity of event sourcing and CQRS.</span></li></ul></div>
